{"id":"IEr6Krdj0DxltWvJwjxdK","meta":{"instanceId":"c5aa9aa20cae9de93dfea50bc54d2c5b13b3d87794732b56f2e4aef76d3b81f4"},"name":"AI Product Image Generator","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"14e98eeb-b84d-4d75-846c-95f2e914a7ec","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-3248,-48],"parameters":{"width":480,"height":896,"content":"## AI Product Image Generator\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow accepts a product image through an n8n form, stores and retrieves it from Google Drive, then prepares it for AI analysis. It uses OpenAI vision and an AI Agent to interpret the image and create three variation prompts, then each branch calls OpenAI's image edit endpoint to generate a new product image. The generated images are converted back into files and uploaded to Google Drive as separate outputs.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the form trigger with a required product image upload field.\n- Connect Google Drive credentials and set the upload/download nodes to the correct source and destination folders.\n- Configure OpenAI credentials for the OpenAI nodes and ensure the HTTP Request nodes can authenticate against https://api.openai.com/v1/images/edits.\n- Review the file field names and binary property names across the extract, convert, download, and upload nodes so each branch passes the correct image data.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the AI Agent instructions and the three message-model prompts to change the style, background, or marketing angle of generated product images. You can also change the OpenAI image model parameters, output size, number of branches, and Google Drive destination folders."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"67ffb531-4d36-45a2-b936-39b9171948f9","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-2688,192],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":240,"height":320,"content":"## Capture form image\n\nStarts the workflow when a user submits the product image form."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"5bc7f5b8-94a1-4357-b9cd-54505b3c84d9","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-2416,176],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":336,"content":"## Stage original file\n\nUploads the submitted image to Google Drive and downloads it again so downstream file-processing nodes can access a consistent file reference."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"70cc59f1-7bba-4ab5-a57d-c6ba1f07e258","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-1968,224],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":624,"height":304,"content":"## Prepare image analysis\n\nExtracts the downloaded image data, converts it into the expected file format, and sends it to OpenAI for visual analysis."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"3eb0ef3a-c01c-4362-821b-0cfa17bcecea","name":"Sticky Note4","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-1312,128],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":368,"height":640,"content":"## Plan image variants\n\nUses an AI Agent, OpenAI chat model, and structured output parser to turn the image analysis into structured creative directions for generated product-image variants."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"6db5f6bd-101e-4f10-8bf6-3a58b391389f","name":"Sticky Note5","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-912,-48],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":240,"height":752,"content":"## Create branch prompts\n\nGenerates three separate OpenAI model messages from the agent output, one for each product-image generation branch."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"ed2586f3-2052-4a51-a6f0-f67913dbecab","name":"Sticky Note6","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-640,32],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":864,"height":304,"content":"## Generate first image\n\nDownloads the source image for the first branch, sends it to OpenAI's image edit endpoint, converts the result to a file, and uploads the finished image to Google Drive."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"04641198-4fe4-406c-9c70-892cc7fcff06","name":"Sticky Note7","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-640,368],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":864,"height":304,"content":"## Generate second image\n\nRuns the middle generation branch by downloading the image, calling the OpenAI image edit endpoint, converting the generated output, and saving it to Google Drive."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"fffd3428-898b-477c-9ae0-2a5f11cae25f","name":"Sticky Note8","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-640,704],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":864,"height":304,"content":"## Generate third image\n\nRuns the lower generation branch by downloading the image, calling the OpenAI image edit endpoint, converting the generated output, and uploading the final image to Google Drive."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"23709d9e-5a06-4510-b910-09ade2a003b7","name":"When Form Submitted","type":"n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger","position":[-2640,352],"webhookId":"04202b51-b9ff-402c-99ab-fc4cde83e86a","parameters":{"options":{},"formTitle":"3 Image generator","formFields":{"values":[{"fieldLabel":"Scene Brief"},{"fieldType":"file","fieldLabel":"Image"},{"fieldLabel":"female/Man"}]},"formDescription":"Please provide the product image and give 3 scene briefs."},"typeVersion":2.5},{"id":"e0806518-39bc-4c90-a401-3fc17af8b665","name":"Post to OpenAI Image Edits","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","position":[-368,160],"parameters":{"url":"https://api.openai.com/v1/images/edits","method":"POST","options":{},"sendBody":true,"contentType":"multipart-form-data","authentication":"predefinedCredentialType","bodyParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"prompt","value":"= A high-resolution, photorealistic Micro close-up focusing on a bag,Earphones should be laying with beside the bag tangled, a sandwish also and bag should lay falt on the floor\n\n[Setting & Lighting] Location: A lush, green park with a soft-focus background of dappled sunlight through tree leaves and a distant stone path.[Technical Style] \"Quiet Luxury\" aesthetic. Professional fashion photography style, 8k resolution, photorealistic, shot on 85mm lens for a flattering compressed perspective. Shallow depth of field (bokeh background), sharp focus on the leather\nMake Sure the image is as detailed as possible and always exact looking.\n\nDo not make any change in the product image.\nLightning should also not effect the colour of the product or any details.\nCandid, natural lighting, real life environment. \nMake sure the Vibe is in \"Quiet Luxury\" Aesthetics."},{"name":"image[]","parameterType":"formBinaryData","inputDataFieldName":"=data"},{"name":"model","value":"gpt-image-2"},{"name":"size","value":"1024x1536"},{"name":"quality ","value":"medium"}]},"nodeCredentialType":"openAiApi"},"credentials":{"openAiApi":{"id":"BO5Rsiv67UpFrTd2","name":"FB posting"}},"typeVersion":4.3},{"id":"59a34875-78c2-4c48-a588-a6f3ee517165","name":"Convert JSON to File Format","type":"n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile","position":[-144,160],"parameters":{"options":{},"operation":"toBinary","sourceProperty":"data[0].b64_json","binaryPropertyName":"image"},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"e45bdb61-255d-4715-b2da-f4fe96f26ac3","name":"Upload File to Google Drive","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive","position":[80,160],"parameters":{"name":"Detailed IMG","driveId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"My Drive"},"options":{},"folderId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"Select your Google Drive folder here"},"inputDataFieldName":"image"},"credentials":{"googleDriveOAuth2Api":{"id":"WH303vJY3A6A7DuJ","name":"Google Drive account 2"}},"typeVersion":3},{"id":"64180aaa-1798-4214-a46e-98cf0d009294","name":"OpenAI Image Analysis","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi","position":[-1488,352],"parameters":{"text":"Analyse the image. Understand the vibe of the brand. Make sure to keep the vibe.","modelId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4o","cachedResultName":"GPT-4O"},"options":{},"resource":"image","inputType":"base64","operation":"analyze"},"credentials":{"openAiApi":{"id":"BO5Rsiv67UpFrTd2","name":"FB posting"}},"typeVersion":2.1},{"id":"e80ecac0-4543-4ead-8172-6721f82e94b0","name":"OpenAI Message Model","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi","position":[-864,352],"parameters":{"modelId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4o","cachedResultName":"GPT-4O"},"options":{},"responses":{"values":[{"content":"=Refine the prompt: {{ $json.output.scenes[1] }}\nMake sure you keep there vibe same which is \"Quite Luxury\" Aesthetics.\nMake sure the lighting is warm but still bright.\nTime: Day Time\nScene have to be zoomed out.\nif there is some character invlove then Model: Female.\n\nGive our Prompt only:\nNo extra text."}]},"builtInTools":{}},"credentials":{"openAiApi":{"id":"BO5Rsiv67UpFrTd2","name":"FB posting"}},"typeVersion":2.1},{"id":"46f4126e-c4ce-48a9-a2ee-149acbe4f88f","name":"Extract Data from File","type":"n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile","position":[-1920,352],"parameters":{"options":{},"operation":"binaryToPropery"},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"3deaf751-3090-44fc-91ec-a3bd787b1f3a","name":"Convert Data to File","type":"n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile","position":[-1696,352],"parameters":{"options":{},"operation":"toBinary","sourceProperty":"data"},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"84b15a4d-983e-436c-9373-c2e4e545f853","name":"AI Analysis Agent","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent","position":[-1248,336],"parameters":{"text":"=Scene Brief: {{ $('When Form Submitted').item.json['Scene Brief'] }}","options":{"systemMessage":"=Here is the scene Brief: {{ $('When Form Submitted').item.json['Scene Brief'] }}\n\nJust write the exact thing in the Json format: \n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"scenes\": [\n    \"scene 1 Brief\",\n    \"scene 2 Brief\",\n    \"scene 3 Brief\"\n  ]\n}\n"},"promptType":"define","hasOutputParser":true},"typeVersion":3.1},{"id":"774588f1-aa5b-4119-a17b-ebdbd9b06316","name":"OpenAI GPT-4 Chat Model","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","position":[-1232,624],"parameters":{"model":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4.1-mini"},"options":{},"builtInTools":{}},"credentials":{"openAiApi":{"id":"BO5Rsiv67UpFrTd2","name":"FB posting"}},"typeVersion":1.3},{"id":"9ddbfd91-c8f4-4c86-80f3-862b27e3d65d","name":"Parse Structured Output","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured","position":[-1056,512],"parameters":{"jsonSchemaExample":"{\n  \"scenes\": [\n    \"scene 1\",\n    \"scene 2\",\n    \"scene 3\"\n  ]\n}"},"typeVersion":1.3},{"id":"071ce314-a1cb-4fd0-999a-314666c49d66","name":"Send Message to OpenAI","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi","position":[-864,544],"parameters":{"modelId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4o","cachedResultName":"GPT-4O"},"options":{},"responses":{"values":[{"content":"=Refine the prompt: Showing Travel LifeStyle with the product\nMake sure you keep there vibe same which is \"Quite Luxury\" Aesthetics.\nMake sure the lighting is warm but still bright.\nTime: Day Time\nif there is some character invlove then Model: Female\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"scenes\": [\n    \"scene 1 Brief\",\n  ]\n}"}]},"builtInTools":{}},"credentials":{"openAiApi":{"id":"BO5Rsiv67UpFrTd2","name":"FB posting"}},"typeVersion":2.1},{"id":"59fd708f-d86c-447c-8012-935d06eab1a2","name":"Upload file3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive","position":[-2368,352],"parameters":{"name":"={{ $json.Image[0].filename }}","driveId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"My Drive"},"options":{},"folderId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"root","cachedResultUrl":"https://drive.google.com/drive","cachedResultName":"/ (Root folder)"},"inputDataFieldName":"=Image"},"credentials":{"googleDriveOAuth2Api":{"id":"WH303vJY3A6A7DuJ","name":"Google Drive account 2"}},"typeVersion":3},{"id":"024b405f-4fd4-4ae0-a802-0bdfa742d3eb","name":"Download file","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive","position":[-2144,352],"parameters":{"fileId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $json.id }}"},"options":{},"operation":"download"},"credentials":{"googleDriveOAuth2Api":{"id":"WH303vJY3A6A7DuJ","name":"Google Drive account 2"}},"typeVersion":3},{"id":"53464c6d-156c-4df5-b483-81514785c0c2","name":"Upload file1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive","position":[80,496],"parameters":{"name":"Product images","driveId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"My Drive"},"options":{},"folderId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"Select your Google Drive folder here"},"inputDataFieldName":"image"},"credentials":{"googleDriveOAuth2Api":{"id":"WH303vJY3A6A7DuJ","name":"Google Drive account 2"}},"typeVersion":3},{"id":"9155d667-54f4-40c6-9bac-11bf969888d8","name":"Convert to File1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile","position":[-144,496],"parameters":{"options":{},"operation":"toBinary","sourceProperty":"data[0].b64_json","binaryPropertyName":"image"},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"7671e014-4bb2-4c08-8bc9-d065c02600f6","name":"Download file2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive","position":[-592,496],"parameters":{"fileId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $('Download file').first().json.id }}"},"options":{},"operation":"download"},"credentials":{"googleDriveOAuth2Api":{"id":"WH303vJY3A6A7DuJ","name":"Google Drive account 2"}},"typeVersion":3},{"id":"d00e8436-c8db-4f5a-93c8-f756304dc08d","name":"Image Generation Model1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","position":[-368,496],"parameters":{"url":"https://api.openai.com/v1/images/edits","method":"POST","options":{},"sendBody":true,"contentType":"multipart-form-data","authentication":"predefinedCredentialType","bodyParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"prompt","value":"=A high quality lifestyle photo of a product {{ $json.output[0].content[0].text }}\nMake Sure the image is as detailed as possible and always exact looking.\nImage have to be zoomed out. do not \nDo not make any chnage in the product image.\nLightning should also not effect the colour of the product or any details.\nCandid, natural lighting, warm tones, real life environment. \nMake sure the Vibe is in \"Quiet Luxury\" Aesthetics.\nWarm but still bright lights."},{"name":"image[]","parameterType":"formBinaryData","inputDataFieldName":"=data"},{"name":"model","value":"gpt-image-2"},{"name":"size","value":"1024x1536"},{"name":"quality ","value":"medium"}]},"nodeCredentialType":"openAiApi"},"credentials":{"openAiApi":{"id":"BO5Rsiv67UpFrTd2","name":"FB posting"}},"typeVersion":4.3},{"id":"7bfc3ba9-378e-4177-af21-337ed61d45c8","name":"Image Generation Model2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","position":[-368,832],"parameters":{"url":"https://api.openai.com/v1/images/edits","method":"POST","options":{},"sendBody":true,"contentType":"multipart-form-data","authentication":"predefinedCredentialType","bodyParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"prompt","value":"=A high quality lifestyle photo of a product {{ $json.output[0].content[0].text }}\nMake Sure the image is as detailed as possible and always exact looking.\nImage have to be zoomed out. do not \nDo not make any chnage in the product image.\nLightning should also not effect the colour of the product or any details.\nCandid, natural lighting, warm tones, real life environment. \nMake sure the Vibe is in \"Quiet Luxury\" Aesthetics.\nWarm but still bright lights."},{"name":"image[]","parameterType":"formBinaryData","inputDataFieldName":"=data"},{"name":"model","value":"gpt-image-2"},{"name":"size","value":"1024x1536"},{"name":"quality ","value":"medium"}]},"nodeCredentialType":"openAiApi"},"credentials":{"openAiApi":{"id":"BO5Rsiv67UpFrTd2","name":"FB posting"}},"typeVersion":4.3},{"id":"ef6bf868-aa97-4916-bc06-d3a9ad110a3b","name":"Convert to File2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile","position":[-144,832],"parameters":{"options":{},"operation":"toBinary","sourceProperty":"data[0].b64_json","binaryPropertyName":"image"},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"e61bcee9-234b-4166-99b7-91270dce3333","name":"Upload file2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive","position":[80,832],"parameters":{"name":"Content","driveId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"My Drive"},"options":{},"folderId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"Select your Google Drive folder here"},"inputDataFieldName":"image"},"credentials":{"googleDriveOAuth2Api":{"id":"WH303vJY3A6A7DuJ","name":"Google Drive account 2"}},"typeVersion":3},{"id":"a7209ccc-8283-4419-b7f4-c76771a9a764","name":"Download file3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive","position":[-592,832],"parameters":{"fileId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $('Download file').first().json.id }}"},"options":{},"operation":"download"},"credentials":{"googleDriveOAuth2Api":{"id":"WH303vJY3A6A7DuJ","name":"Google Drive account 2"}},"typeVersion":3},{"id":"cb45814e-3858-4f1e-918e-af3af59cc474","name":"Message a model1","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi","position":[-864,160],"parameters":{"modelId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4.1","cachedResultName":"GPT-4.1"},"options":{},"responses":{"values":[{"content":"=Refine the User prompt: {{ $('When Form Submitted').item.json['Scene Brief'] }}\nModel:{{ $('When Form Submitted').item.json['female/Man'] }}\nCheck the User prompt and analyic what a user wants.\nMake sure you keep there vibe same which is \"Quite Luxury\" Aesthetics.\n\nGive our Prompt only:\nNo extra text."}]},"builtInTools":{}},"credentials":{"openAiApi":{"id":"BO5Rsiv67UpFrTd2","name":"FB posting"}},"typeVersion":2.1},{"id":"630a1b88-0514-4ce5-a873-ac6811f40ba7","name":"Download file1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive","position":[-592,160],"parameters":{"fileId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $('Download file').first().json.id }}"},"options":{},"operation":"download"},"credentials":{"googleDriveOAuth2Api":{"id":"WH303vJY3A6A7DuJ","name":"Google Drive account 2"}},"typeVersion":3}],"active":false,"pinData":{},"settings":{"availableInMCP":false,"executionOrder":"v1"},"versionId":"bc93b3a2-b905-4adc-ab19-270309eb601d","connections":{"Upload file3":{"main":[[{"node":"Download file","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Download file":{"main":[[{"node":"Extract Data from File","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Download file1":{"main":[[{"node":"Post to OpenAI Image Edits","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Download file2":{"main":[[{"node":"Image Generation Model1","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Download file3":{"main":[[{"node":"Image Generation Model2","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Convert to File1":{"main":[[{"node":"Upload file1","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Convert to File2":{"main":[[{"node":"Upload file2","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Message a model1":{"main":[[{"node":"Download file1","type":"main","index":0}]]},"AI Analysis Agent":{"main":[[{"node":"Message a model1","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"OpenAI Message Model","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Send Message to OpenAI","type":"main","index":0}]]},"When Form Submitted":{"main":[[{"node":"Upload file3","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Convert Data to File":{"main":[[{"node":"OpenAI Image Analysis","type":"main","index":0}]]},"OpenAI Message Model":{"main":[[{"node":"Download file2","type":"main","index":0}]]},"OpenAI Image Analysis":{"main":[[{"node":"AI Analysis Agent","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Extract Data from File":{"main":[[{"node":"Convert Data to File","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Send Message to OpenAI":{"main":[[{"node":"Download file3","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Image Generation Model1":{"main":[[{"node":"Convert to File1","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Image Generation Model2":{"main":[[{"node":"Convert to File2","type":"main","index":0}]]},"OpenAI GPT-4 Chat Model":{"ai_languageModel":[[{"node":"AI Analysis Agent","type":"ai_languageModel","index":0}]]},"Parse Structured Output":{"ai_outputParser":[[{"node":"AI Analysis Agent","type":"ai_outputParser","index":0}]]},"Post to OpenAI Image Edits":{"main":[[{"node":"Convert JSON to File Format","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Convert JSON to File Format":{"main":[[{"node":"Upload File to Google Drive","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}